DESCRIPTION:Montréal\nSOLIDARITY PROTEST AGAINST POLICE STATE Fascist Viol
 ence\, Intimidation and Terror in Delhi Protests all over India Call for s
 olidarity October 12\, at 12 noon Norman Bethune Square (metro Guy-Concord
 ia) Saturday October 10th was a dark day for democracy in the so-called la
 rgest democracy in the world – India\, as Prime Minister Modi of the BJP
  (Bharatiya Janata Party) effectively declared war on the people to pre-em
 pt a demonstration to protest the disenfranchisement of more than million 
 Indians in recent elections and demand the removal of India’s Chief Elec
 tion Commissioner. “The streets of New Delhi and surrounding areas were 
 transformed into a sprawling\, hyper-militarised fortress with metal spike
 s\, yellow barricades and concrete barriers on Saturday as the full coerci
 ve machinery of…\nOfficial page: https://www.instagram.com/p/DeXAHRvEY2O
